r flooding is forecast.\n\n* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.\n\n* WHERE...Purgatoire River near Purgatoire R near Las Animas.\n\n* WHEN...From this morning to Sunday morning.\n\n* IMPACTS...At 9.0 feet, Minor Flood. Minor agricultural flooding\noccurs into low lying areas along the river.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 8:15 AM MDT Thursday the stage was 8.9 feet.\n- Forecast...The river will rise above flood stage late this\nmorning to 10.5 feet this evening. It will then fall early\ntomorrow afternoon. It will rise to 9.5 feet Saturday morning. It\nwill then fall below flood stage late Saturday evening.\n- Flood stage is 9.0 feet.\n- Flood History...This crest compares to a previous crest of 10.5\nfeet on 08/19/2004.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood","ends":"2026-10-04T09:00:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Bent, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.3e98b8d6f90a246f1361b950c20f3b9588e9d2a7.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.3e98b8d6f90a246f1361b950c20f3b9588e9d2a7.001.1"}}]}